casting.yaml.lock is generated on YOUR machine by `foundryctl forge -f casting.yaml`.
It cannot be produced in this scaffold (no Docker/foundryctl here).

DO THIS on Day 0, then commit the real lock file:
    foundryctl forge -f casting.yaml     # writes casting.yaml.lock
    make repro-check                     # confirms it exists and is not gitignored
    git add casting.yaml casting.yaml.lock && git commit -m "chore: pin Foundry deployment"

The hackathon requires BOTH casting.yaml and casting.yaml.lock in the repo so
judges can re-run Foundry and reproduce your exact SigNoz + MCP deployment.
